{
  "content": "<!-- Locations Content -->\n    <section class=\"locations-map-section home-section\" data-reveal>\n        <div class=\"locations-content\">\n            <div class=\"locations-intro\">\n                <p class=\"home-section__label\">Kanto</p>\n                <h2 class=\"home-section__title\">Bãi camping chúng mình hay đưa khách</h2>\n                <p class=\"locations-intro__text\">\n                    <span class=\"no-break\">Camp Nhà Thỏ</span> chọn lọc những bãi camping đẹp quanh Kanto — từ view Phú Sĩ, hồ núi lửa đến bờ biển và suối trong lành. Chọn vùng bên dưới, xem trên bản đồ, rồi khám phá từng điểm đến.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <section class=\"locations-regions home-section\" data-reveal aria-labelledby=\"location-filter-heading\">\n                    <p class=\"home-section__label\">Khu vực</p>\n                    <h2 id=\"location-filter-heading\" class=\"home-section__title\">Chọn vùng khám phá</h2>\n                    <div class=\"locations-filters\">\n                        <div class=\"locations-regions__grid\" role=\"group\" aria-labelledby=\"location-filter-heading\">\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"filter-tag-btn locations-region__card locations-region__card--featured\" data-filter-tag=\"view-phu-si\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n                            <img src=\"/images/location-fumotoppara.webp\" alt=\"Camping view núi Phú Sĩ\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                            <span class=\"locations-region__label\">View Phú Sĩ</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"filter-tag-btn locations-region__card\" data-filter-tag=\"gan-bien\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n                            <img src=\"/images/location-koganezaki.webp\" alt=\"Camping gần biển\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                            <span class=\"locations-region__label\">Gần biển</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"filter-tag-btn locations-region__card\" data-filter-tag=\"gan-ho\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n                            <img src=\"/images/location-tanukiko.webp\" alt=\"Camping gần hồ\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                            <span class=\"locations-region__label\">Gần hồ</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"filter-tag-btn locations-region__card\" data-filter-tag=\"gan-tokyo\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n                            <img src=\"/images/location-recamp-ashikaga.webp\" alt=\"Camping gần Tokyo\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                            <span class=\"locations-region__label\">Gần Tokyo</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"filter-tag-btn locations-region__card\" data-filter-tag=\"gan-suoi-song\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n                            <img src=\"/images/location-nagatoro-auto-campground.webp\" alt=\"Camping gần suối sông\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                            <span class=\"locations-region__label\">Gần suối / sông</span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button type=\"button\" class=\"filter-tag-btn locations-region__card locations-region__card--wide\" data-filter-tag=\"mua-thu\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n                            <img src=\"/images/location-asagiri-sorairo.webp\" alt=\"Camping mùa thu\" width=\"800\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                            <span class=\"locations-region__label\">Mùa thu</span>\n                        </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n            <section cl