=\"location-tag-chip\">Mùa xuân</span>\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">Mùa hè</span>\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">Mùa thu</span>\n                        </div>\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Koan+Camping+Ground/@35.4737088,138.5765894,16.06z/data=!4m15!1m5!3m4!2zMzXCsDI4JzIzLjUiTiAxMzjCsDM0JzI5LjIiRQ!8m2!3d35.473183!4d138.574764!3m8!1s0x601be615f5b7e6b9:0x777d79ff931f3ee3!5m2!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d35.473183!4d138.574764!16s%2Fg%2F119vp5061?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"location-map-link\">Google Maps</a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n\n                        <article class=\"location-detail location-gallery-card\" tabindex=\"0\" data-site-id=\"asagiri-sorairo\" data-tags=\"view-phu-si mua-xuan mua-he mua-thu\">\n                            <div class=\"location-gallery-card__media\">\n                                <img src=\"/images/location-asagiri-sorairo.jpg\" alt=\"朝霧Camp Base そらいろ - Bãi camping gần Fumotoppara với view Phú Sĩ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"location-gallery-card__overlay\">\n                                <h3>Asagiri Camp Base Sorairo</h3>\n                                <p class=\"location-subtitle\">朝霧Camp Base そらいろ</p>\n                                <div class=\"location-gallery-card__footer\">\n                                    <div class=\"location-tags\" aria-label=\"Đặc điểm nổi bật\">\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">View Phú Sĩ</span>\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">Mùa xuân</span>\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">Mùa hè</span>\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">