ujisan+Wild+Adventure/@35.3302986,138.6143224,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!3m8!1s0x601bdb1ad33feedb:0xb6a32ab837014576!5m2!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d35.3302986!4d138.6168973!16s%2Fg%2F11f7r2s0c2?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"location-map-link\">Google Maps</a>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n\n                        <article class=\"location-detail location-gallery-card\" tabindex=\"0\" data-site-id=\"fujiminooka\" data-tags=\"view-phu-si mua-xuan mua-he mua-thu\">\n                            <div class=\"location-gallery-card__media\">\n                                <img src=\"/images/location-fujiminooka.jpg\" alt=\"Fujiminooka Auto Camping Ground - Bãi camping với không gian rộng và view núi Phú Sĩ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"location-gallery-card__overlay\">\n                                <h3>Fujiminooka Auto Camping Ground</h3>\n                                <p class=\"location-subtitle\">富士見の丘オートキャンプ場</p>\n                                <div class=\"location-gallery-card__footer\">\n                                    <div class=\"location-tags\" aria-label=\"Đặc điểm nổi bật\">\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">View Phú Sĩ</span>\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">Mùa xuân</span>\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">Mùa hè</span>\n                            <span class=\"location-tag-chip\">Mùa thu</span>\n                        </div>\n                                    <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Fujiminooka+Auto+Camping+Ground/@35.2179438,138.6999732,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m9!3m8!1s0x601bd5749e08b1d1:0xe680720c4d3b36b0!5m2!4m1!1i2!8m2!3d35.2179438!4d138.7025481!16s%2Fg%2F11qpswg4_h?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDMwOC4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw